---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description={`${site.name} is a cycling blog. Tours, roads, and travel by bike.`}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="site-shell about">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1 class="section-title">A cycling blog</h1>
      <p class="lead">{site.tagline}</p>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          <strong>The Soul Searchers</strong> is a cycling blog. We write about riding bikes and
          using them to travel: road, gravel, loaded touring, a weekend overnighter, a bike on a
          German train, a climb before breakfast, a coast road with salt on the bars.
        </p>
        <p>
          This is not a race team. This is not a shop. No wattage lectures. We care about the
          kilometres that show you a town, a pass, a bakery, a language you don’t speak yet. The
          bike is the way we look at this planet.
        </p>
        <p>
          What you will find here: shots on <a href="/now">Now</a> (newest photos first), ride
          stories with pictures, notes on packing and trains, café stops that are part of the day,
          and the odd reminder that a wrong turn on a bike often becomes the best road of the tour.
        </p>
        <blockquote>
          Clip in. Check the tyres. Look up from the stem. The planet is bigger than the cue sheet.
        </blockquote>
        <p>
          If you ride a road bike, a tourer, gravel, whatever gets you down the tarmac, you are in
          the right place. Bring a pump. Bring curiosity. See you on the road.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/stories">The rides</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/journal">Ride notes</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 44rem;
  }

  .lead {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 1.7rem);
    color: rgba(238, 243, 247, 0.9);
  }

  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
</style>
